  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently our metadata in F3 is stored in DMDINDEX.xml file primarily with custom schema in Solr, moving to F6 our custom metadatafield does not get indexed with camel-toolbox. I have attached in this ticket some sample DMDINDEX files for reference to see if plumbing can be build in cameltoolbox (maybe with XPATH) to get metadata fields from migrated DMDINDEX xml files so it is possible to map DMDINDEX fields in Solr so that they can be displayed in blacklight UI",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
